OL,3,GNEWSAOfficer injured as football fans
OL,4,Apull down barriers
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer suffered a minor
OL,7,Finjury during an outbreak of disorder
OL,8,Fafter the south coast derby between
OL,9,FSouthampton and Portsmouth.
OL,11,FFans from both sides pulled down
OL,12,Ffencing in Southampton streets to try
OL,13,Fto reach each other after the game,
OL,14,FHampshire Police said.
OL,16,FHowever, officers and stewards managed
OL,17,Fto prevent any breach of the barriers,
OL,18,Fthe force added.
OL,20,FIt said officers would analyse CCTV and
OL,21,Fdrone footage to identify those
OL,22,Fresponsible.
